{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Personal stack mappings, merged with config/project-stack-mappings.json by scripts/personal-setup.js (via my-ecc/profile.json). A stack here with the same id as an upstream stack replaces the upstream one. Indicators use the upstream format: a file name (a * wildcard is allowed in the last path segment) and an optional case-insensitive 'contains' text.",
